    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to make a \"mark\" when you're just drownng in paperwork and errors. what's the point of fighting for a place in a world that's basically decided you're just an error code? it feels like everything is just... empty. like there's no way to actually win against something that doesn't even have a heart.",
